XI1 (vdd VSS net2 net0 net3) nand
XI2 (vdd VSS net3 p1) delay_chain
XI3 (vdd VSS clk p1 net1) nand
XI4 (vdd VSS net1 net2) delay_chain
XI5 (vdd VSS net2 p2) inv
