subckt half_bridge (vDD VSS clk_in sw)
MNM0 (sw g2 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=50 nf=1 m=1024
MPM0 (sw g1 vDD vDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=50 nf=1 m=4096
Xbuffer (vDD VSS net1 g1) buffer
XbufferN (vDD VSS net0 g2) bufferN
Xnon_overlap (vDD VSS clk_in net0 net1) non_overlap
